# Tags and fragments

```rocci
<div>
    <Hello />
    <>
        <br>
    </>
</div>
```

| Form | Meaning | Generated |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `<div>` | Intrinsic HTML | `Html.element` |
| `<Hello />` | Local component | `hello({ … })` |
| `<Design.Button />` | Qualified component | `Design.button({ … })` |
| `<>…</>` | Fragment | `Html.fragment` |
| `<br>` / `<img />` | Void HTML | `Html.void_element` |

Unknown PascalCase tags still lower to calls; Roc reports missing values later.
Self-closing component tags are one-argument calls. Paired tags pass the body
as the second argument.

**Limits:** no dynamic tag names.

